      "到达废墟，携带刷子，并带上用于标记板的铜。地图集必须认识到旅行不仅仅是一条直线。"
    ],
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.dialogue.offer.response.accept.label": "标记路线",
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.dialogue.offer.response.decline.label": "另一次",
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.dialogue.reminder.label": "关于第一远标记",
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.dialogue.reminder.lines": [
