    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.objective.bring_copper.tracker.text": "带8块铜锭来制作标记板。",
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.objective.carry_brush.tracker.complete_text": "准备好一支笔，用于现场笔记。",
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.objective.carry_brush.tracker.text": "携带一把刷子，这样就可以在不破坏废墟的情况下阅读它们。",
    "quest.cartographers_atlas.first_far_marker.stage.survey.objective.visit_ruins.tracker.complete_text": "第一个远方路标已被访问。",
